    "designStatus": "USER-REQUIREMENT-DESIGN-REVIEWED-P1-CONTRACT",
    "implementationStatus": "UNVERIFIED",
    "bindingBoundary": "语义设计责任名称，不声明 Operator 已注册或 runtime 执行",
    "outcomeBoundary": "业务不满足条件时输出保留当前 turn/待补充的结果；不伪造 checkpoint 提交或强行执行。",
    "existingCheckpointDesign": "native-turn-checkpoint.graph.json",
    "assignmentContract": "普通 execution/review 仍由 assignment 明确角色任务；只有 execution 显式 check 时才选择正式 definition，并按需打开同一 logical turn 的 occurrence。Runtime 必须先提交 stage-declared 与 assignment-transition 事实，再取得执行许可。",
    "assignmentGraphContract": "AssignmentGraphStream 只含 taskScope 与 ownerId；stage-declared 保留空 stage、parent 与成员顺序；assignment-transition 原子保存 post-assignment 与 post-stage，保留 stage.state 的最后写值。同一 assignment key 不得迁移到另一个 stage。",
    "commitBeforeEffect": "stage 与 assignment 的真实 Journal commit 是 acquire、execute、publish、review 和 merge 的前置事实。提交结果不确定时保留原请求，不安装未确认状态，也不进入依赖副作用。",
    "inspectionBindingContract": "checkpoint 保存子调用绑定与未返回义务；显式 check 时绑定检查，context 只从该 typed binding 恢复独立 Provider/model 与执行上下文。",
    "executionContract": "普通 execution/review 保持原角色作用；显式 check 时才产生完整 child 正文与独立 typed delivery，业务文本不是控制真源。",
    "acceptanceContract": "acceptance 接纳 durable child return；显式 check 时才由 Runtime 幂等补 I2 receipt。assignment 的接纳、review、retry、blocked、escalated、succeeded 与 merged 转移都先提交 graph fact，再向调用方或下游发布结果。恢复只补缺失提交，不重启 child。",
    "runtimeCoordination": {
      "ownerPath": "packages/runtime/src/agent-loop/inspection-turn-boundary.ts",
      "status": "planned/unimplemented"
    },
    "appWiringBoundary": "App 只提供 wiring，不拥有 inspection turn boundary 或检查状态。"
  },
